 a single player. It has a 60 second cooldown, however its initial cooldown is set to 0, allowing to be used on Wave 1. Its cooldown does not start until the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Festive Tree"]}," disappears."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwFQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Usage"},"children":["Usage"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["When using the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Festive Tree"]},", a light brown pot with a dark green tree will appear, which can be placed on any part of the map. When placed down, it will lower the stun duration from enemies by 30%. It has a range of 16."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["This does not stack with other ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Festive Trees"]},"."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwGg"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Appearance"},"children":["Appearance"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Festive Tree"]}," is a dark green tree that has been planted into a pot. The tree is decorated with different colored ornaments."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwHQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Strategy"},"children":["Strategy"]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Festive Tree"]}," can be used as a replacement for the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Medic","title":"Medic"},"children":["Medic"]}," tower as it has a very similar purpose.\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["However, if a player has the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Medic","title":"Medic"},"children":["Medic"]}," tower equipped, then this consumable serves no purpose.\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["As such, players should save their Consumable slot for something else."]}]}]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":["T